WEBVTT

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:12.420
You could say that they admired and worshipped him.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:19.640
To the vassals, being in the presence of the Baron was akin to the euphoria induced by drugs.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.010
It was worth fighting to try and win time with him.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:26.810
However, there was something the Baron had misunderstood.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:33.320
Many of the vassals were not necessarily loyal to him personally...

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:38.860
...but were simply captivated by the Abh race as a whole.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:45.370
They viewed the Abh world as something of a heavenly world...

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:50.920
...knowing full well that amongst Abh noblemen, the Baron was nothing more than average.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.090
The vassals were fascinated...

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:56.460
...with a genuine Abh princess.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:31.380
Bar Garhath

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:31.380
The Way of the Abh

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.300
Your Highness, please wait!

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.220
Take this with you.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:44.180
I'm sure His Excellency will need a weapon too.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:46.970
You'll also need a weapon yourself.

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:50.890
I have the gun that Kuhaspia left behind.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:52.390
All right.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.190
I have one more favor to ask of you.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.610
What a great honor, Your Highness.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.650
I want to be able to speak to Jinto from within the shuttle.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.070
Is that possible?

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.490
Can I really trust you women?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.200
Trust?

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:13.080
Are you questioning our loyalty?

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:13.750
Exactly!

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:15.920
Of course you can, Master.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.960
It is regrettable that you ask such a question.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:21.800
I see.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.720
You are my true vassals.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.890
Will you follow even if I make the princess our enemy?

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.230
We will follow even if the Empress herself became an enemy.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.520
<i>This is housekeeping.</i>

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.060
<i>Attention all vassals.</i>

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.230
<i>Currently, a struggle is underway...</i>

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:36.980
What?!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.650
<i>...on this baronial spaceport.</i>

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.570
<i>I repeat, a struggle has begun.</i>

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:46.450
<i>The cause is that our master, His Excellency Baron Feubdach...</i>

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.120
<i>...has wrongfully impounded the princess' transfer shuttle.</i>

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:56.170
<i>Together with His Excellency the Count Haïder who had arrived here as well...</i>

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.210
<i>...the princess wishes to leave this region immediately</i>

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:00.920
<i>That is why...</i>

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.960
Logic crystal!

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:05.930
<i>Connection cannot be made to the logic crystal network.</i>

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.090
Why not?!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:11.560
<i>Transmission through communicators is impossible.</i>

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.640
<i>Please use a fixed terminal.</i>

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.350
Damn!

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:17.190
They must've done this!

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:19.900
Activate the terminal!

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.360
<i>...wishes that we cooperate with her.</i>

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.740
<i>So, my dear friends...</i>

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.990
<i>...let's cooperate with the princess.</i>

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:32.410
<i>The princess has promised to accept everyone...</i>

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.080
<i>...who cooperates as a vassal of the Crybh family.</i>

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:35.330
That's a lie!

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:38.420
Royal families don't easily accept vassals!

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.880
Muinishu, the terminal?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:41.960
No luck.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.550
I can't connect.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.970
Damn traitors!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.050
How far do they plan to go?!

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.390
You girls, come with me!

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:52.140
I'll use a different terminal.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.430
Muinishu, you stay back and carry out my orders.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.020
Please wait one moment.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.020
Intruder to the shuttle again!

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:01.150
What?!

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:29.570
Jinto...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:30.680
Jinto...

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.450
<i>The clyuno you are calling is not being worn.</i>

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:33.790
Not yet, huh.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.480
Then I'll fuel up first.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:45.980
I can re-fuel on my own there.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:47.700
Just like in training.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.790
He's trying to keep me from re-fueling!

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:18.310
He destroyed all the anti-matter fuel in one shot.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.770
Well done...

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:22.940
...Baron.

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:27.400
After I rescue Jinto...

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:29.740
...I'm going to kill you.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:31.990
You can count on it.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.200
<i>Your Highness,</i>

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:38.410
<i>we were able to deliver the clyuno during meal delivery.</i>

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.330
<i>You can communicate now.</i>

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:41.460
Lafiel!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:42.920
Jinto.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:44.880
Listen to me.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.340
I can't dock, so I won't be able to attach to the hatch.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:49.840
What do you mean?

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:50.880
<i>Well...</i>

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.010
<i>Is there a pressure suit in there?</i>

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:54.640
<i>If there is, we have no problem.</i>

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.100
I figured you might say that.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:01.310
No, there are no pressure suits.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.270
<i>I see.</i>

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.270
<i>Then you'll have to swim through a vacuum.</i>

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.270
<i>I'll try to get as close as I can.</i>

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.820
<i>Open the hatch when I tell you.</i>

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.110
<i>I'll send down a ladder.</i>

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:12.700
That'll help.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:17.370
You don't seriously think this'll work, do you?

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.250
You will join me, right?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.870
You're going to open the hatch even if I refuse, right?

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:27.040
Well, I have no intention of withering away in this place.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:34.930
The transfer shuttle is positioning itself above the Baron senior's quarters.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.640
Haven't they given up yet?

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.350
We'll abandon this area.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.940
All of you, take a weapon and follow me.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.360
You know...

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:56.120
...our standing is too low to even receive a Count, let alone Her Highness the Princess.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.910
Our family's moving up in the world.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:03.000
My late mother would be thrilled to hear of this.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:05.750
Jinto,

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:07.500
preparations are complete at my end.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:08.590
<i>Same here.</i>

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.210
You must step away from below the hatch.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.220
I'm shooting the ladder in.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:14.590
Understood.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.890
Let me know once you've grabbed hold of the rope ladder.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:21.810
I'll pull you up while there's still air.

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.060
I hope that's the case.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:24.850
Ready?

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:25.640
Yes.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:27.350
Okay...

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.690
How about some work other than just cleaning for a change?

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.240
Right, spidey?

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.080
Turn it!

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:03.350
Okay, pull us up! Lafiel!

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.460
Hi, Lafiel.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.800
That looks good on you.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.470
Jinto!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.020
Are you injured?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:29.940
As you can see.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.150
Good.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.360
You're an important commodity to me.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:37.570
I'd be inconvenienced if you got hurt.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:41.280
See?

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:49.120
That should show just how much Her Highness is in love with me.

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:56.380
The air is getting thin.

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:57.800
You're right.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:10:59.590
Damn.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.300
And l know exactly why.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.590
Hey, traitors!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:04.300
Can you hear me?!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:05.550
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.140
<i>Would you be quiet? You're being rude.</i>

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.380
<i>I'm not being rude!</i>

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:09.980
<i>Yes, Master.</i>

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:11.560
Grieda?

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:15.020
So, you've got the nerve to still call me master...

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.770
...after betraying me.

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:18.320
<i>I'm terribly sorry.</i>

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:19.530
Never mind now.

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:22.320
Have we lost pressure in the retirement quarters?

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.820
<i>Yes, we have.</i>

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:26.660
Are you dealing with it?

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:28.290
<i>Yes, Mast...</i>

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.580
<i>...Your Excellency.</i>

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.870
<i>We've closed off all the air circulation ducts.</i>

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.580
Is that all?

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.670
How about the waste disposal system?

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.000
<i>I'd forgotten!</i>

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.670
We'll all be in trouble if the air runs out!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:44.180
Deal with it immediately!

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.140
<i>Unfortunately...</i>

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.810
<i>...the waste disposal ducts cannot be closed automatically.</i>

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.100
<i>We can't do anything about it.</i>

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:51.600
You fool!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.060
Close it by hand!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:57.270
No, get the space workers on to restoring the pressure.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:01.530
If you're going to revolt, at least think it through properly!

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:04.450
Is your skull stuffed with your stomach or something?

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.530
<i>But, we're in a state of confusion here...</i>

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:08.120
No excuses, you fool!

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:11.330
You girls, quickly go to the transit hall.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:15.290
If you see Her Highness there, restrain her at once.

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:17.250
What will you do, Master?

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:18.840
I'm going outside.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:21.210
This is a battle.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.220
Just badmouth the princess one more time...

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:26.660
...and I'll show you!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.180
Let go of me, you traitor!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.810
Everyone, listen to me!

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.350
What is it, Grieda?!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.770
We're busy right now!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.810
I'm even busier here!

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:42.030
No distractions! Turn off the receiver!

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:43.610
Yes.

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.070
This is housekeeping.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.440
The whole spaceport is depressurizing.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.540
For the time being, do not use the waste disposal...

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:57.880
...and should you find an open vent, close it immediately.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.880
Depressurizing?!

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:01.250
That's right.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.460
It seems that...

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:06.180
...Her Highness opened the hatch in the retirement quarters...

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.760
...and forgot to close it.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:09.970
See what happened?!

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:13.640
Her Highness doesn't care what happens to us.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:14.980
This is proof of that!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:15.640
Shut up!

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:18.940
Sernaic...

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.270
...you have a license for space work, don't you?

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.400
Yes. My work requires it.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.030
But, what do you have in mind?

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:30.990
Obviously, we need you to close the hatch to that block.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.740
But I can't do it alone.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.580
Everyone else, go with Sernaic.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.040
She'll be in charge.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.460
I'm a waitress.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.670
I haven't got a license for space work...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.210
...and I don't want to work under Sernaic.

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.510
Get some specialists.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:50.930
Besides, Grieda, what authority do you have to order me to-

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:51.890
Will you shut up?!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.060
We've got no time for your nonsense.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.310
Now, get going!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.690
We're not trained for this, so we can't waste time!

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.610
Grieda's right.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.400
Everyone, come with me.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.820
If you don't want to die, that is.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.750
Aren't you going to come, Grieda?

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.330
I'm the head of the housekeeping section.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.210
I'm needed here.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.510
His Excellency is on our side.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.260
Your Highness...

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:31.430
...it seems that my unworthy son has caused you trouble.

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:37.470
I'd be thankful if you could help me teach him a lesson or two.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.850
Unfortunately, I cannot do that.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.270
I'm about to kill him.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:43.810
But...

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:47.900
...don't you think that's a bit extreme, Your Highness?

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:51.660
Your son has made it impossible for me to complete my mission.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:54.490
He's blown up the fuel asteroids.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:55.450
All of them!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.830
You and I and Jinto are stuck here.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.790
That's a problem.

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:03.630
Is that all you feel about this?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.210
Aren't you angry?

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.000
Of course, I'm angry.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:08.590
That's a lie!

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.510
I'm really tired now, Lafiel.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.930
I'll be angrier later.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:13.340
Fool.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:15.720
Now, now, Your Highness.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:19.350
I might just be able to do something about the fuel.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:20.680
But how?!

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:24.440
Has my son also destroyed the anti-matter fuel plants?

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.320
No. As far as I know, they're untouched.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:31.280
In that case, you can use the fuel we find at the factories.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.410
But the Baron has taken over the control room.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.490
Your plan won't work unless we take the control room.

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:42.410
The senior Baron himself designed the spaceport.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:45.130
He says it's not hard to override the logic crystal.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.130
It's not for you to brag about.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.130
In any case, let me give it a try.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:56.470
Then, if all goes well, will you let me take care of my son?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.010
Is this a conditional offer?

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.720
Anything wrong with that?

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:03.600
I really need to discipline him myself for what he's done.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:04.770
That's fine.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.190
However, if the Baron continues to get in our way...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:09.610
...it will change things.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.320
As you wish.

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:14.950
Okay, let me get started.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:30.380
I see Her Highness is heading for the Number 11 factory.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:32.300
Control room, can you hear me?

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:34.700
<i>Yes, this is control room.</i>

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:38.100
<i>Is our remote connected with the Number 11 factory?</i>

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:39.600
Well...

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.930
...for some reason, the control functions...

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.440
...appear to be in very unstable condition.

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:47.150
It's not responding to my inputs.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:51.400
<i>How in the world was Her Highness able to do this?</i>

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.780
Father...

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:00.200
Your Highness.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.430
We may have a problem here.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:03.410
What is it?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.370
My son has taken the Ponyu.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.580
Is this Ponyu armed?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:11.840
Well, is it?

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.380
I think this is the one.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:19.340
The Segno 947, built at the Dugteif plant

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:25.430
It's equipped with two specially-loaded Lengarf 40 cohesive beam guns.

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:27.730
Do you think we can control it?

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:29.480
Can't be done.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:34.940
He's disconnected the logic crystal of his ship from the spaceport's logic crystal network.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.150
As it turns out...

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:40.030
...I might have to kill your son after all.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.410
Guess it can't be helped.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:48.290
But, I thought this shuttle is unarmed.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.000
Yes, it's unarmed.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:53.920
Then, where do you get your confidence from?

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:55.340
Confidence?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.930
This is typical of how the Abh think.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:04.680
It's not as if Her Highness believes she can definitely win.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:07.270
There's no sense thinking about what we'd do after we're killed.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:12.200
She's just warning me in the event that we were to win.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:15.070
Then what did you think, Jinto?

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:16.940
Well...

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:24.080
His Excellency thought that you disregarded the possibility that this ship may be destroyed.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.250
Do you take me for a fool?

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.160
Our chances of winning this battle are less than 10%.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.170
Of course I know that.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.420
But you still choose to fight?

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:35.960
What other choice do we have?

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.720
This is also typical of the Abh.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.930
The Abh would rather fight for a 10% chance than surrender.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:46.570
To the Abh, this is the obvious choice without question.

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.560
Is there a problem?

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.440
Not at all, Your Highness.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:52.400
Although not genetically, I am also an Abh.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:55.190
I certainly know when I need to fight.

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:56.690
And you, Jinto?

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:58.690
I'm just a commodity, right?

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:01.110
So, I don't have an opinion.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:06.120
But, remember me from time to time just the same.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:11.170
Time to settle this, once and for all...

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:11.870
...Your Highness.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:15.920
Good-bye, Father...

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.300
He's near.

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:20.510
Yes, he is.

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.300
We're within his target range.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:23.640
Can you tell?

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:24.720
It's a hunch.

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:28.060
It's impossible to detect light speed weapons ahead of time.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.600
So, this is a battle of hunches.

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:31.810
He's here!

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:41.030
You're only a young pilot trainee.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.860
You won't be able to get away from me.

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:49.330
This is not practice.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.210
Not practice.

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.420
I've got a split second to make my move.

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.880
If I miss that, I won't have a second chance!

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:06.800
Not yet, he's still too far.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:08.970
A little more...

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:10.520
A little more...

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.320
Now!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:19.980
Terminate main engine.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:22.740
Decelerate, full power!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:26.760
What?!

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:28.490
What's she thinking?!

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:29.990
Here I go!

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:32.450
Ignite main engine!

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:35.830
Fool!

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:38.880
Did you think my ship could be damaged with propellants?

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:41.630
What's this...?!

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:53.430
She added anti-matter to the propellant.

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:07.670
Bravo, Your Highness.

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:18.380
It's over.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:21.880
Did you kill the Baron?

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:23.550
I killed him.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:28.800
Baron, I'm sorry for your loss.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.640
It's all right.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.020
It was a battle.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:36.100
I'm sorry?! Is that it?!

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:38.350
What are you so upset about?

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:41.320
You just killed somebody.

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.900
If I didn't kill him, he would've killed us.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:47.150
I know that!

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:47.530
But-

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.240
That's enough, young man.

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:52.950
There's nothing for you to be upset about.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:57.040
You just didn't want to see Her Highness kill someone, right?

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:59.460
Is what the Baron says true?

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:03.550
Well, yeah. I guess so.

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:04.510
Why is that?

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:07.400
Well, you see, that's...

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.340
Just so it's clear, we were in a battle.

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:11.720
I know we were.

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:15.180
Is there a problem with me winning a battle?

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:16.480
Not at all.

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:19.730
Just think if we had lost.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.440
Then, why is it?

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.940
Well, that's hard to answer.

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:26.440
Anyway, sorry.

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:30.030
And thank you. You protected me, after all.

00:22:33.070 --> 00:22:33.660
Accepted.

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:35.540
You shall be grateful.

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:38.000
Thank you.

00:22:38.270 --> 00:22:44.040
Well, now that that's settled, I'll go and seize my domain.

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:50.010
My pitiful son...

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:55.510
The senior Baron was not crying.

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:02.460
But hidden in his words was a deep sense of sorrow.

00:24:31.790 --> 00:24:37.750
<i>Praise the United Mankind for your liberation from the reign of the Humankind Empire Abh.</i>

00:24:38.630 --> 00:24:41.920
<i>Our reason for coming to Sfagnomr...</i>

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:45.880
<i>...is to retaliate against the belligerent actions of the Abh.</i>

00:24:47.130 --> 00:24:52.760
<i>While we were scanning the planar space surrounding a newly discovered saudec...</i>

00:24:52.760 --> 00:24:55.850
<i>...an Imperial warship suddenly opened fire on us.</i>

00:24:56.230 --> 00:24:56.980
That's a lie!

00:24:57.270 --> 00:24:59.980
Next episode

00:24:57.270 --> 00:24:59.980
To the Battlefield

00:24:57.270 --> 00:24:59.980
Ïucrabé
